====================
 dbt7-generate-data
====================

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-generate-data** [option...] directory

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-generate-data** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) **dsdgen** wrapper.
It generates the flat data files outside of the execution of a load test,
primarily to aid testing changes to **dsdgen** or generating chunks of data
in parallel.

OPTIONS
=======

--parallel=CHUNKS  Parallelize the data generation into CHUNKS parts,
        default 1 (no parallelism).
-s SCALE, --scale-factor=SCALE  *scale* factor, roughly equivalent to GB
        (base 10) of text data, default 1.
--seed=SEED  Set RNGSEED for **dsdgen**, default unset.
--tpcdstools=DSHOME  *dshome* is the directory location of the TPC-DS
        Tools.
-V, --version  Output version information, then exit.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

*directory* is the path to save the flat files.

ENVIRONMENT
===========

**DSHOME**

    This is the absolute path to the TPC-DS Tools directory.  The
    --tpcdstools argument will override this environment variable.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-run**\ (1), **dbt7-load-test**\ (1)
